.TH "libnvme_free_huge" 9 "libnvme_free_huge" "October 2026" "libnvme API manual" LINUX
.SH NAME
libnvme_free_huge \- Free a huge page-backed memory buffer
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B "void" libnvme_free_huge
.BI "(struct libnvme_mem_huge *mh "  ");"
.SH ARGUMENTS
.IP "mh" 12
Huge memory allocation descriptor
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
Releases resources associated with a buffer allocated by
\fBlibnvme_alloc_huge\fP. The descriptor contents are no longer valid after
this call.
